{"3680860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solitary", "steam_appid": 3680860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solitary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a silent, white room.<br>No clues. No instructions. No color.<br>Only a chair, a bed, a table — and a voice that doesn’t seem too concerned with your confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solitary</i></strong> is a short first-person psychological experience about isolation, routine, and the slow unraveling of reality. Designed with minimal UI and ambient storytelling, the game leads you through a series of surreal spaces — each one stranger and more detached than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t be told what to do.<br>But you’ll want to keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of abstract, atmospheric rooms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A padded white space that slowly populates with sterile furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A temple-like chamber of cold light and pillars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowing platforms suspended in a dark, endless void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maze with hidden rules and invisible truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something waiting at the end... or maybe the beginning</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic narrator who evolves with your choices — playful, observant, and maybe just a little too involved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet descent into something you were never meant to understand</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solitary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a silent, white room.<br>No clues. No instructions. No color.<br>Only a chair, a bed, a table — and a voice that doesn’t seem too concerned with your confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Solitary</i></strong> is a short first-person psychological experience about isolation, routine, and the slow unraveling of reality. Designed with minimal UI and ambient storytelling, the game leads you through a series of surreal spaces — each one stranger and more detached than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t be told what to do.<br>But you’ll want to keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of abstract, atmospheric rooms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A padded white space that slowly populates with sterile furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A temple-like chamber of cold light and pillars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glowing platforms suspended in a dark, endless void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maze with hidden rules and invisible truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something waiting at the end... or maybe the beginning</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic narrator who evolves with your choices — playful, observant, and maybe just a little too involved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quiet descent into something you were never meant to understand</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You wake up in a silent white room with no exit—just a voice that follows you through five strange spaces, growing more unsettling as the world twists around you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680860/e52dd878be761034853c604e895f20a1870ccbe6/header.jpg?t=1778775642", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680860/54109ed4f35ef1096eee19407a4c7d9f533f8b70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778775642", "capsule_i